{"cluster_id": "C-4269", "topic": "The E5 soak recorded CasRefMaterializeInPlace=81,467 versus CasRefMaterializeCopy=14", "target": "operations/monitoring", "member_ids": ["B023-030"], "canonical_claim": "The E5 soak recorded `CasRefMaterializeInPlace=81,467` versus `CasRefMaterializeCopy=14`, indicating that the in-place fast path handled 99.98% of production materializations.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/worklogs/2026-07-21-unattended-reftablestate-experiments.md#timeline"]}
